            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present invention relates to an electrode assembly comprising a plurality of electrode structures comprising a positive electrode, a negative electrode, and a solid electrolyte layer disposed the positive electrode and the negative electrode, and polymer layers at both ends of the electrode assembly, and a secondary battery comprising the same.</p>
